OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and showers, the
OL,6,Fshowers heavy and frequent at times.
OL,7,FThe west or southwest winds will
OL,8,Fbecome strong to gale force across
OL,9,FOrkney, lighter and more variable in
OL,10,FShetland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FFurther showers through the
OL,13,Fevening and overnight, heavy and
OL,14,Ffrequent at times. Strong to gale
OL,15,Fforce westerly winds over Orkney will
OL,16,Fease a touch, but winds strengthen for
OL,17,FShetland overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
