OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,6,Fsome showers, becoming lighter and
OL,7,Fmore isolated through the day. Strong
OL,8,Fwesterly winds at first will become
OL,9,Flight through the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,12,Fwith rain and then showers on Sunday.
OL,13,FBright spells and showers on Monday.
OL,14,FOccasionally heavy showers or longer
OL,15,Fspells of rain on Tuesday and becoming
OL,16,Fwindy for a time.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
